# Preserve shipped SEAPS features (no silent regressions)

When editing this repository, **do not overwrite or drop** previously approved work unless the user explicitly asks to remove or replace that specific feature.

## Before any broad restore or `git checkout` of many files

1. **Never** run `git checkout <old-commit> -- .` or `git add -A` after mixed edits without listing what will change.
2. If recovering one broken file, **checkout only that file path**, not the whole tree.
3. After merges or conflict resolution, verify these **regression checkpoints**:

### Homepage (`src/app/page.tsx`)

- Hero: logo + `brand.fullName` centered in the **left column** (not full-page center).
- Hero copy: full SEAPS award-winning company text (not the old “Cambodia property marketplace…” stub).
- No “Popular agencies” / agency directory block on the homepage.

### Navigation (`src/components/layout/site-header.tsx`)

- First item: **About Us** → `/about`.
- **Buy** / **Rent** dropdowns: Land, Residential, Commercial (Commercial → `/commercial`; no top-level Commercial item).
- Residential catalogs: `/buy/residential`, `/rent/residential` (`/buy` and `/rent` redirect).
- **Projects/Developments** → `/projects`.
- **Property Guide** → `/property-guide`, **Careers** → `/careers`.
- **No Market Feed** in nav (removed; `/market-feed` redirects to `/search`).
- **Useful Links** → `/usefullinks` (not `/agencies`).
- Nav links use **`seaps-gold-text`** (living gold), with **`notranslate`** on nav.
- Header background: `rgba(7,17,31,0.92)` fallback + optional `color-mix`.
- Mobile menu breakpoint: **`md`**, not only `lg`.

### Branding & people

- Public person display name: **Adam James** (agents, demo users, article authors).
- No public agency directory pages or links to `/agencies/*` (redirects to `/usefullinks` are OK).

### Styles (`src/app/globals.css`)

- Gold text **solid fallback** when `background-clip: text` fails.
- **`seaps-brand-subtitle`** for hero company name (must stay visible in all browsers).

### Security (do not revert)

- HMAC-signed `en_session` + bcrypt passwords.
- Private Blob persistence patterns documented in repo where used.

### About & contact

- `/about`: full About Us copy, YouTube awards embed, bottom **Contact Us** gold button + validated modal.

## When the user reports “everything reverted”

1. Diff against tag `backup/2026-10-16-post-design-cross-browser` or commit `f296e24` for UI baseline.
2. Restore **only** regressed files; re-apply newer features (About Us, Useful Links, Contact modal) on top.
3. Run `npm run build`, then `bash scripts/push-production.sh`.

## Commits

- One logical change per commit; never bundle unrelated file restores with feature work.
- Document restorations in the commit message (`fix: restore hero copy accidentally reverted in …`).
